1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:06,720
Every time I close my eyes, I see the same scene play out.

2
00:00:07,840 --> 00:00:09,620
Jeez, would you quit walking so fast?

3
00:00:09,820 --> 00:00:12,540
Wait up! I'm family! Don't abandon me, you!

4
00:00:12,900 --> 00:00:15,200
I don't have a family. Leave me alone!

5
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:17,500
Sorry, no can do.

6
00:00:17,920 --> 00:00:22,100
The director said everyone from the Hakuya Orphanage is family, so shut up and deal with it!

7
00:00:22,880 --> 00:00:24,000
Get off of me!

8
00:00:25,100 --> 00:00:26,900
We are a family, aren't we?

9
00:00:27,280 --> 00:00:29,180
Duh! Of course we are, silly!

10
00:00:29,180 --> 00:00:31,560
One big happy family. Isn't that right, you?

11
00:00:32,820 --> 00:00:35,400
Honestly, you guys are a pain in the butt.

12
00:00:39,480 --> 00:00:46,180
I see the smiling faces of my dearest friends, my family, and then...

13
00:00:46,780 --> 00:00:53,280
I see their bloody, lifeless bodies lying in front of me.

14
00:00:59,180 --> 00:01:02,780
Let you leave us. Get out of here.

15
00:01:11,280 --> 00:01:13,740
Forget about us. Just go.

16
00:01:15,520 --> 00:01:16,180
Hurry.

17
00:01:16,180 --> 00:01:34,520
It never fails. Even after four years, I'm still haunted by my painful memories of that night.

18
00:01:34,520 --> 00:01:51,680
It's the four horsemen of John!

19
00:01:51,680 --> 00:01:57,780
What the hell are you doing here?

20
00:01:58,120 --> 00:02:00,180
Get out of the combat zone, Private Hyakuya!

21
00:02:00,400 --> 00:02:01,200
That's an order!

22
00:02:01,860 --> 00:02:03,120
Who, me? Run away?

23
00:02:03,380 --> 00:02:04,400
Don't count on it.

24
00:02:05,780 --> 00:02:09,240
The only reason I'm here is to get revenge on those blood-sucking freaks.

25
00:02:09,740 --> 00:02:11,680
I can't handle a small fire like this one...

26
00:02:11,680 --> 00:02:14,860
Then I don't have to start to take another breath!

27
00:02:15,320 --> 00:02:16,860
Private, stop!

28
00:02:16,860 --> 00:02:18,080
Initiality

29
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:21,460
Pực

30
00:02:21,720 --> 00:02:22,460
...

31
00:02:23,540 --> 00:02:23,600
...

32
00:02:23,860 --> 00:02:24,380
...

33
00:02:25,080 --> 00:02:25,280
...

34
00:02:31,080 --> 00:02:32,000
...

35
00:02:33,300 --> 00:02:33,500
...

36
00:02:33,500 --> 00:02:33,800
...

37
00:02:33,800 --> 00:02:34,720
...

38
00:02:34,720 --> 00:02:47,220
I don't want nobody to get killed

39
00:02:47,220 --> 00:02:54,800
I'll come and get you, I'm always ready to fight

40
00:02:56,940 --> 00:03:01,160
So don't take all of the blame, we're always wet

41
00:03:01,160 --> 00:03:04,880
I'll wait on, take all of the blame, we always do

42
00:03:04,880 --> 00:03:08,660
There will always be something you cannot control

43
00:03:08,660 --> 00:03:12,900
We will overcome, your salvation has begun

44
00:03:12,900 --> 00:03:18,300
No sun, no light, such a mess, I'm over

45
00:03:18,300 --> 00:03:26,900
Don't kill your wounds, you make me realize who I need

46
00:03:26,900 --> 00:03:31,660
I'll be there, hold on, the change is somehow

47
00:03:31,660 --> 00:03:34,540
So where are you now?

48
00:03:35,160 --> 00:03:39,300
I'll reach you, my top, the shadows of the earth

49
00:03:39,300 --> 00:03:42,340
Illusions apart

50
00:03:42,340 --> 00:03:47,940
The golden end is still wrong, but I know it is a pain

51
00:03:47,940 --> 00:03:50,660
I've made a stupid man after

52
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:54,160
We're all torn to save you for the good show

53
00:03:54,160 --> 00:03:56,060
About your precious work

54
00:03:56,060 --> 00:03:59,500
This is hard to respond to your call

55
00:03:59,500 --> 00:04:14,420
This is a load of crap

56
00:04:14,420 --> 00:04:17,900
I kill a monster and get slapped with a suspension?

57
00:04:18,520 --> 00:04:19,860
They should be promoting me

58
00:04:19,860 --> 00:04:22,340
Not making me rot in this civilian dump

59
00:04:22,340 --> 00:04:24,840
I'm a soldier, dammit

60
00:04:24,840 --> 00:04:28,200
Hey, what are you mumbling about over there?

61
00:04:28,700 --> 00:04:30,480
Do you have something you'd like to add?

62
00:04:30,940 --> 00:04:32,440
If so, then let's hear it

63
00:04:32,440 --> 00:04:36,300
You better shape up, Yakuya

64
00:04:36,300 --> 00:04:37,920
Don't give me any more trouble

65
00:04:37,920 --> 00:04:39,080
I'll have you suspended

66
00:04:39,080 --> 00:04:41,480
What? You'd really kick me out of here?

67
00:04:41,900 --> 00:04:42,360
Awesome!

68
00:04:42,900 --> 00:04:45,000
Well then, I humbly request suspension

69
00:04:45,000 --> 00:04:45,560
How dare you!

70
00:04:45,980 --> 00:04:46,420
Enough!

71
00:04:46,660 --> 00:04:48,940
I won't have you mocking me in front of the class

72
00:04:48,940 --> 00:04:52,280
Sit down and pay attention

73
00:04:52,280 --> 00:04:54,780
What? You got something to say?

74
00:04:59,520 --> 00:05:00,000
Huh?

75
00:05:08,320 --> 00:05:10,780
If you continue to behave uncooperatively

76
00:05:10,780 --> 00:05:13,400
I will have no choice but to report you to the army

77
00:05:13,400 --> 00:05:14,640
And extend your suspension

78
00:05:14,640 --> 00:05:15,940
What?

79
00:05:16,360 --> 00:05:17,680
You've got to be kidding me!

80
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:18,340
That's it!

81
00:05:18,600 --> 00:05:20,860
One more outburst and I'm sending you straight to them

82
00:05:20,860 --> 00:05:23,080
This sucks! Let me finish!

83
00:05:23,720 --> 00:05:25,060
Start cooperating

84
00:05:25,060 --> 00:05:33,500
Now, where were we?

85
00:05:34,100 --> 00:05:34,800
Ah, yes

86
00:05:34,800 --> 00:05:38,300
I should also point out that your suspension will remain in effect

87
00:05:38,300 --> 00:05:40,160
Until you successfully make a friend

88
00:05:40,160 --> 00:05:43,120
You heard right

89
00:05:43,120 --> 00:05:45,640
So play nice and be a good student

90
00:05:45,640 --> 00:05:55,440
But how can you be a human?

91
00:05:56,120 --> 00:05:57,640
Everyone on the surface died!

92
00:05:58,640 --> 00:06:00,100
That what the vamps told you?

93
00:06:00,600 --> 00:06:03,020
I guess I would have done the same in their shoes

94
00:06:03,020 --> 00:06:10,180
Well, it's true that the virus reduced the world's population by about 90%

95
00:06:10,180 --> 00:06:12,360
And thanks to the trumpets of the apocalypse

96
00:06:12,360 --> 00:06:15,080
An army of bizarre-looking monsters are now roaming the earth

97
00:06:15,080 --> 00:06:17,940
But it will take more than that to wipe out mankind

98
00:06:17,940 --> 00:06:21,440
Our resurrection is underway

99
00:06:21,440 --> 00:06:22,660
Resurrection?

100
00:06:23,200 --> 00:06:24,840
Yep, and that's not all

101
00:06:24,840 --> 00:06:28,720
We have plans to make sure our organization ends up on top

102
00:06:28,720 --> 00:06:32,840
We're going to take back the earth and gather humanity's remnants under one banner

103
00:06:32,840 --> 00:06:33,940
No way

104
00:06:33,940 --> 00:06:35,940
So who are you guys?

105
00:06:38,680 --> 00:06:40,220
Lieutenant Colonel Ichinose

106
00:06:40,220 --> 00:06:41,540
Call me Gurren

107
00:06:41,540 --> 00:06:43,860
I'm with the Imperial Demon Army

108
00:06:43,860 --> 00:06:48,740
Kid, how would you like to come with us and get back at those bloodsuckers?

109
00:06:50,420 --> 00:06:51,520
Put this on him

110
00:06:51,520 --> 00:06:59,020
Tell me

111
00:06:59,020 --> 00:07:00,860
Do you want to get back at the vampires?

112
00:07:06,100 --> 00:07:06,900
I do

113
00:07:06,900 --> 00:07:09,840
If you want your revenge, take my hand

114
00:07:09,840 --> 00:07:12,800
I'll give you all the power you need

115
00:07:12,800 --> 00:07:18,220
More like take my hand and I'll ignore you

116
00:07:18,220 --> 00:07:21,680
You promised me power, Gurren, not a four-year waste of my time

117
00:07:21,680 --> 00:07:24,520
I'm skipping practice

118
00:07:24,520 --> 00:07:27,160
Okay, let's get ice cream on the way home

119
00:07:27,160 --> 00:07:31,900
Wait up, mind if I come along?

120
00:07:32,000 --> 00:07:34,180
I could really go for a cone right now

121
00:07:34,180 --> 00:07:37,460
You just missed a golden opportunity to make some new friends

122
00:07:37,460 --> 00:07:39,100
Are you trying to boss me around?

123
00:07:39,340 --> 00:07:40,480
It's not a good idea

124
00:07:40,480 --> 00:07:43,540
There's that famous attitude I've heard about

125
00:07:43,540 --> 00:07:45,720
According to Lieutenant Colonel Gurren

126
00:07:45,720 --> 00:07:48,440
You avoid social interaction because you lost your family

127
00:07:48,440 --> 00:07:50,860
You're too afraid to engage other people

128
00:07:50,860 --> 00:07:54,140
You fear making connections

129
00:07:54,140 --> 00:07:56,320
Or letting anyone get close to you

130
00:07:56,320 --> 00:07:58,180
Because you're afraid you may lose them

131
00:07:58,180 --> 00:07:59,820
It sounds lonely

132
00:07:59,820 --> 00:08:02,220
Don't you want a girlfriend or maybe a boy?

133
00:08:03,100 --> 00:08:04,940
Look, I'm not afraid of anything

134
00:08:04,940 --> 00:08:07,140
So quit running your mouth and get off my back

135
00:08:07,140 --> 00:08:09,040
I guess you can engage

136
00:08:09,040 --> 00:08:11,920
If you won't shut up, then use your trap for something useful

137
00:08:11,920 --> 00:08:15,140
Like telling Gurren to put me in the vampire extermination unit

138
00:08:15,140 --> 00:08:16,720
I'm ready

139
00:08:16,720 --> 00:08:19,560
Give me the chance to make the fangs bleed for a change

140
00:08:19,560 --> 00:08:23,980
Here, he thought you might say that

141
00:08:23,980 --> 00:08:26,360
So the Lieutenant Colonel told me to give this to you

142
00:08:26,360 --> 00:08:28,740
Now that's what I'm talking about

143
00:08:28,740 --> 00:08:30,700
I knew he hadn't forgotten me

144
00:08:30,700 --> 00:08:34,180
Cherry boys that can't make a friend or a girlfriend

145
00:08:34,180 --> 00:08:35,560
Don't belong in our army

146
00:08:35,560 --> 00:08:38,060
Go out, make one, then introduce them to me

147
00:08:38,060 --> 00:08:40,920
Of course, I'm not gonna hold my breath

148
00:08:40,920 --> 00:08:48,420
Who's he think he is?

149
00:08:48,700 --> 00:08:49,900
You can both go to hell

150
00:08:49,900 --> 00:08:55,080
What are you doing?

151
00:08:55,680 --> 00:08:57,080
Haven't you annoyed me enough?

152
00:08:57,580 --> 00:08:58,940
Stop following me around

153
00:08:58,940 --> 00:09:01,360
Sorry, no can do

154
00:09:01,360 --> 00:09:04,220
I am your army surveillance officer after all

155
00:09:04,220 --> 00:09:08,080
Any violation of army guidelines will be reported

156
00:09:08,080 --> 00:09:08,960
Would you please stop?

157
00:09:10,380 --> 00:09:11,420
Stop what?

158
00:09:11,560 --> 00:09:12,940
I'm just asking you to be a pal

159
00:09:12,940 --> 00:09:14,420
And lend me some money for a snack

160
00:09:14,420 --> 00:09:15,720
Got a problem, Wythe?

161
00:09:15,800 --> 00:09:22,240
Sucks to be him

162
00:09:22,240 --> 00:09:25,040
Whatever, I'm out of here

163
00:09:25,040 --> 00:09:27,600
I'm disappointed in you, Private

164
00:09:27,600 --> 00:09:28,960
You won't make any friends

165
00:09:28,960 --> 00:09:31,060
If you keep turning your back on people in need

166
00:09:31,060 --> 00:09:32,400
What's the hold up?

167
00:09:32,460 --> 00:09:34,180
You want to be friends with us, don't you?

168
00:09:34,620 --> 00:09:36,060
Come on, hand it over

169
00:09:36,060 --> 00:09:38,220
Or I'll stick the vampires on you

170
00:09:38,220 --> 00:09:40,040
What?

171
00:09:40,360 --> 00:09:41,620
You want me to kick your ass?

172
00:09:41,820 --> 00:09:44,100
Hey, give it a rest, you punks

173
00:09:44,100 --> 00:09:45,980
Why?

174
00:09:46,560 --> 00:09:47,660
Who in the hell are you?

175
00:09:48,740 --> 00:09:49,620
What's this?

176
00:09:50,280 --> 00:09:51,340
Showing compassion?

177
00:09:51,740 --> 00:09:53,500
You might just prove your file wrong

178
00:09:53,500 --> 00:09:57,940
Punks, huh?

179
00:09:58,420 --> 00:09:59,720
We got a tough guy

180
00:09:59,720 --> 00:10:01,880
You want to play the hero, is that it?

181
00:10:02,120 --> 00:10:02,860
All right, then

182
00:10:02,860 --> 00:10:06,100
After we beat your face in, you can be our new errand boy

183
00:10:06,100 --> 00:10:06,980
Awesome

184
00:10:06,980 --> 00:10:09,220
See, this is why I love bullies

185
00:10:09,220 --> 00:10:11,600
They're simple and stupid

186
00:10:11,600 --> 00:10:13,680
Okay, want to fight?

187
00:10:14,240 --> 00:10:14,920
Let's go

188
00:10:14,920 --> 00:10:16,020
What?

189
00:10:16,800 --> 00:10:18,980
Oh, I should have mentioned this before

190
00:10:18,980 --> 00:10:22,440
Fighting civilians is prohibited and will extend your suspension

191
00:10:22,440 --> 00:10:29,360
Running errands for those jerks

192
00:10:29,360 --> 00:10:31,840
Why me, man?

193
00:10:34,040 --> 00:10:35,600
Um, I'm sorry

194
00:10:35,600 --> 00:10:37,080
This is all my fault

195
00:10:37,080 --> 00:10:38,600
You've got hands

196
00:10:38,600 --> 00:10:39,900
Help us carry stuff

197
00:10:39,900 --> 00:10:42,240
I'm only here to observe

198
00:10:42,240 --> 00:10:43,020
Sorry

199
00:10:43,020 --> 00:10:44,000
Figures

200
00:10:44,000 --> 00:10:46,080
Please, forgive me

201
00:10:46,080 --> 00:10:48,140
Quit apologizing every two seconds

202
00:10:48,140 --> 00:10:49,060
It's really annoying

203
00:10:49,060 --> 00:10:50,680
What's your problem, anyway?

204
00:10:50,680 --> 00:10:53,560
Why do you let those jerkwads bully you like that?

205
00:10:54,820 --> 00:10:56,200
I'm not being bullied

206
00:10:56,200 --> 00:10:56,800
Oh, right

207
00:10:56,800 --> 00:10:59,560
So he just happened to use your face as a stepping stool

208
00:10:59,560 --> 00:11:00,780
No, it's true

209
00:11:00,780 --> 00:11:02,700
They really aren't bullying me

210
00:11:02,700 --> 00:11:03,700
What?

211
00:11:04,200 --> 00:11:04,500
Yeah

212
00:11:04,500 --> 00:11:07,440
You see, I have a favor I need to ask of Yamanaka

213
00:11:07,440 --> 00:11:11,320
And, well, getting on his good side isn't exactly easy

214
00:11:11,320 --> 00:11:12,940
Which one was Yamanaka?

215
00:11:13,600 --> 00:11:14,080
Seriously?

216
00:11:14,080 --> 00:11:15,880
Are you really that dense?

217
00:11:18,300 --> 00:11:20,760
Yamanaka's the guy who sucker punched you in the face

218
00:11:20,760 --> 00:11:22,880
Oh, him

219
00:11:22,880 --> 00:11:27,020
So, what?

220
00:11:27,640 --> 00:11:28,440
You his fanboy?

221
00:11:29,260 --> 00:11:30,680
No, not exactly

222
00:11:30,680 --> 00:11:33,860
I failed the Imperial Demon Army's entrance exam

223
00:11:33,860 --> 00:11:35,780
I've always wanted to join them

224
00:11:35,780 --> 00:11:39,220
But Yamanaka, he passed with flying colors

225
00:11:39,220 --> 00:11:42,080
He's even being considered for the Moon Demon Company

226
00:11:42,080 --> 00:11:43,880
No freaking way

227
00:11:43,880 --> 00:11:44,980
That guy?

228
00:11:45,520 --> 00:11:47,200
Who wouldn't even let me in?

229
00:11:48,300 --> 00:11:49,440
Corinne, you jerk

230
00:11:49,440 --> 00:11:50,660
You'll pay for this?

231
00:11:50,660 --> 00:11:53,240
So, I was hoping he'd have some connections

232
00:11:53,240 --> 00:11:54,940
If he knows the right people

233
00:11:54,940 --> 00:11:57,520
Maybe I could get another shot at the entrance exam

234
00:11:57,520 --> 00:11:59,980
I know I'm not much of a soldier

235
00:11:59,980 --> 00:12:03,020
And there's no place for weaklings in the army

236
00:12:03,020 --> 00:12:04,240
But

237
00:12:04,240 --> 00:12:05,760
What?

238
00:12:07,280 --> 00:12:08,440
If I join

239
00:12:08,440 --> 00:12:10,960
I can get revenge for my sister

240
00:12:10,960 --> 00:12:12,000
Revenge?

241
00:12:13,740 --> 00:12:16,100
My sister was killed by a vampire

242
00:12:16,100 --> 00:12:17,840
She was trying to protect me

243
00:12:17,840 --> 00:12:21,860
I froze

244
00:12:21,860 --> 00:12:23,920
I wanted to save her, but I couldn't

245
00:12:24,760 --> 00:12:25,440
And so

246
00:12:25,440 --> 00:12:32,800
Moron

247
00:12:32,800 --> 00:12:35,000
If you had helped her, you'd be dead too

248
00:12:35,000 --> 00:12:37,540
Then she would have died for nothing

249
00:12:37,540 --> 00:12:38,340
But

250
00:12:38,340 --> 00:12:39,580
No buts

251
00:12:39,580 --> 00:12:41,740
Let me give you some advice

252
00:12:41,740 --> 00:12:43,600
Don't join the army

253
00:12:43,600 --> 00:12:45,300
Remember

254
00:12:45,300 --> 00:12:47,800
Your sister doesn't want revenge

255
00:12:47,800 --> 00:12:48,500
She's gone

256
00:12:48,500 --> 00:12:52,900
Besides

257
00:12:52,900 --> 00:12:54,940
A wimpy kid like you would only get in the way

258
00:12:54,940 --> 00:12:57,300
We need to kill the fangs, not feed them

259
00:12:57,300 --> 00:13:18,680
Emergency alert

260
00:13:18,680 --> 00:13:21,540
All students and faculty members be advised

261
00:13:21,540 --> 00:13:25,380
A vampire has escaped from the nearby bio-research facility

262
00:13:25,380 --> 00:13:28,160
Why would a vampire want to come here?

263
00:13:28,480 --> 00:13:30,620
If it's in the school, we're as good as dead

264
00:13:30,620 --> 00:13:31,560
You two be quiet

265
00:13:31,560 --> 00:13:36,680
Vampires regain their strength by drinking blood

266
00:13:36,680 --> 00:13:39,320
Both of you, get out of here quickly

267
00:13:39,320 --> 00:13:41,880
I'll call the Moon Demon company and take care of them

268
00:13:41,880 --> 00:13:42,440
Screw them

269
00:13:42,440 --> 00:13:46,020
I'll kill the sucker with my own two hands

270
00:13:46,020 --> 00:13:46,520
What?

271
00:13:46,660 --> 00:13:47,920
You'll have to let me join

272
00:13:47,920 --> 00:13:49,880
I'm gonna make Goron eat his words

273
00:13:49,880 --> 00:13:52,380
Hey, wait a minute

274
00:13:52,380 --> 00:13:53,460
That's suicide

275
00:13:53,460 --> 00:13:54,660
You idiot

276
00:13:54,660 --> 00:13:57,020
Continue the evacuation in an orderly fashion

277
00:13:57,020 --> 00:13:58,400
I repeat

278
00:13:58,400 --> 00:14:00,700
Emergency responders are on report

279
00:14:00,700 --> 00:14:01,260
Whatever

280
