361
00:19:10,960 --> 00:19:11,660
No, sir.

362
00:19:12,420 --> 00:19:18,520
Anyway, the rules Shinoa gave you remain the same. If you can't make a friend of this school, then I won't have you join in...

363
00:19:18,520 --> 00:19:23,380
What is it with you trying to force me to make friends? It's not like it's gonna help you kill more vampires.

364
00:19:23,380 --> 00:19:24,860
