399
00:21:23,220 --> 00:21:25,420
You put your lives on the line and fought bravely.

400
00:21:25,420 --> 00:21:27,740
For people you don't even know.

401
00:21:28,400 --> 00:21:30,780
Gentlemen, welcome to Moon Demon Company.

402
00:21:33,640 --> 00:21:36,020
From now on, you're one of us.

403
